{"id": "70449", "title": "淫辱优等生", "author": "未知", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 18, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70449/70449s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70449.htm", "intro": "黄昏，少女独自走在回家的路上，因为考试临近的关系少女最近一段时间都会留校温习到黄昏甚至晚上才回家。\n    回家的路程会穿过一个公园，少女在公园中走着的时候突然听到一阵杂乱的脚步声快速接近，刚想回头一看怎知头回不到一半少女已经被人一把抓着了。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70449", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10971827.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10971828.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10971829.html", "available": true}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10971830.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10971831.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10971832.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10971833.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10972361.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10972362.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10972363.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10972364.html", "available": true}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10972365.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10972366.html", "available": true}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10972367.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10972368.html", "available": true}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "10972369.html", "available": true}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "10972370.html", "available": true}, {"title": "86", "file": "10972371.html", "available": true}]}